      "contentHtml": "<p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"slide\"><div class=\"slide-title\"><span>Mẫu đàm thoại 1</span></div><div class=\"slide-content\"><p></p> <p> <img decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\" src=\"/images/minnamoi/bai42/renshuuC-1.jpg\" style=\"width: 300px; \"></p> <p> <audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\"><source src=\"/Audio/minnarenshuc/10001010101.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"></audio></p> <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"khung\" style=\" width: 100%;\"> <tbody> <tr> <td style=\"width: 60px;\"> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>A:</span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><ruby>日本<rp>(</rp><rt>にほん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>へ <ruby>来<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>た <ruby>目的<rp>(</rp><rt>もくてき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は <ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ですか。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Mục đích đến Nhật là gì vậy?</div></div></div></td> </tr> <tr> <td> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>B: </span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><u><ruby>大学<rp>(</rp><rt>だいがく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で <ruby>政治<rp>(</rp><rt>せいじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を <ruby>勉強<rp>(</rp><rt>べんきょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>する</u>ために、<ruby>来<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ました。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Tôi đến để học chính trị ở trường đại học.</div></div></div></td> </tr> <tr> <td> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>A:</span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">そうですか。<ruby>頑張<rp>(</rp><rt>がんば</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>って ください。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Vậy à. Cố lên nhé.</div></div></div></td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p> <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 128);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: ari