city: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">À, đồ khui hộp đúng không. Ở kệ đằng kia có đấy.</div></div></div></td> </tr> <tr> <td> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>A:</span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">どうも。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Cảm ơn.</div></div></div></td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p> <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 128);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span><strong>Luyện tập: </strong></span></span></span></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><em><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">[thay thế vị trí gạch chân bằng nội dung bên dưới]</span></em></span></p> <p> <span>1)</span></p> <p> ① <ruby>瓶<rp>(</rp><rt>びん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の ふたを <ruby>開<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>けます</p> <p> ② <ruby>栓抜<rp>(</rp><rt>せんぬ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>き</p> <p> <span>2)</span></p> <p> ① お<ruby>湯<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を <ruby>沸<rp>(</rp><rt>わ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>かします</p> <p> ② やかん</p> <p> </p></div></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"slide\"><div class=\"slide-title\"><span>Mẫu đàm thoại 3</span></div><div class=\"slide-content\"><p></p> <p> <img decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\" src=\"/images/minnamoi/bai42/renshuuC-3.jpg\" style=\"width: 300px; \"></p> <p> <audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\"><source src=\"/Audio/minnarenshuc/10001010111.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"></audio></p> <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"khung\" style=\" width: 100%;\"> <tbody> <tr> <td style=\"width: 60px;\"> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>A:</span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><ruby>東京<rp>(</rp><rt>とうきょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の <ruby>生活<rp>(</rp><rt>せいかつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は どうですか。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Cuộc sống Tokyo thế nào?</div></div></div></td> </tr> <tr> <td> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>B: </span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">おもしろいですが、①<u><ruby>家賃<rp>(</rp><rt>やちん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が <ruby>高<rp>(</rp><rt>たか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くて</u>、<ruby>大変<rp>(</rp><rt>たいへん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Thú vị, nhưng mà tiền nhà cao nên vất vả.</div></div></div></td> </tr> <tr> <td> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>A:</span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">へえ。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Thế à.</div></div></div></td> </tr> <tr> <td> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>B:</span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">②<u>アパートを <ruby>借<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りる</u>のに ③<u>８<ruby>万<rp>(</rp><rt>まん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>円<rp>(</rp><rt>えん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby> かかる</u>んです。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Mất 80.000 Yên để thuê một căn phòng trọ.</div></div></div></td> </tr> <tr> <td> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>A:</span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">それは <ruby>大変<rp>(</rp><rt>たいへん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ですね。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Thật vất vả nhỉ.</div></div></div></td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p> <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 128);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span><strong>Luyện tập: </strong></span></span></span></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><em><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">[thay thế vị trí gạch chân bằng nội dung bên dưới]</span></em